# spec: on the QC Ultra 2, set_cnc reads the live settings register [31.10] and writes it back with only the CNC level changed.
# source: NOTES.md, "The real CNC path: [31.10] AudioModesSettingsConfig" (5-byte payload [cnc, autoCNC, spatial, wind, anc]). Synthetic: the current settings read back (cnc 5, auto off, spatial off, wind off, ANC on).
device qc_ultra2
call set_cnc 2
send 1f 0a 01 00
recv 1f 0a 03 05 05 00 00 00 01
send 1f 0a 02 05 02 00 00 00 01
recv 1f 0a 03 05 02 00 00 00 01
result ok
